    "body": "Triage: `P3`, `bug`, `area:ui`, `effort:medium`.\n\nWhy: a user finds the wrong highlight shape, and the pick still works. A workaround exists: change the view angle. So it is `P3`, not `P2`: the last release has no such wedge. The fix is in the pick-highlight mesh code of `crates/ui`. One crate, a known rendering pattern. The change can affect no posted G-code, collision check, simulation, or CAM geometry, so the safety floor does not apply.\n",
